    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Lower Mill Pond, created in 1836, supplied waterpower to the mills and factories that powered Milford’s early economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milford%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1939 Henry Ford built a carburetor plant and two hydroelectric stations in Milford, allowing residents to farm and work in the factories.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
